    "title": "This Weekend in Kansas City: July 10-July 12 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago July 10–12 If you need a little stroll-and-shop time, you have plenty of options this weekend. When it comes to World Cup piggybacks, few have pleasantly surprised like the City of Entrepreneurs Marketplace in Union Station. It’s a horseshoe-shaped market in Grand Plaza (the place near the model trains) with 60 local vendors—you’ll find art, vintage clothing, gooey butter cake, and even a barber. It’s free to enter, and this Thursday through Sunday is its last hurrah. (For bonus points, stop by our photo booth on your way out of Union Station.) Read full article",
